---
description: A-share quant project constraints for the coding agent
alwaysApply: true
---

This repo is an A-share (China mainland) daily quant research system, not crypto.

- Never use same-bar close as the fill for a same-bar signal (no look-ahead). Default: T close signal, T+1 open/close fill.
- Simulate T+1, lot size 100, stamp tax on sells, halt / limit-up-down / ST.
- Do not add live broker order routing unless the user explicitly asks.
- LLM keys live in `.env` (`AI_API_KEY`); never commit secrets. AI is optional: review + `ai_select`, with multi-factor fallback.
- Prefer extending `Strategy.on_date` over copying the backtest loop.
